@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam dpi 300

|Hub Manager|
start
:Open Management Reporting Console;
:Select target Hub location (or All Hubs);
:Select reporting date range (Weekly / Monthly / Custom);
:Select required KPI metrics (Sales, Station Load, Courier SLA);
:Click 'Generate Report';

|SaigonBite System|
:Validate filter parameters and date validity;
:Query completed Orders, Kitchen Tickets and Delivery Tasks;
:Aggregate total sales volume and gross revenue;
:Calculate kitchen station capacity utilization percentage;
:Compute average delivery transit time and SLA breach count;
:Compile KPI data into consolidated ManagementReport snapshot;
:Render interactive graphical dashboard & summary metrics;

|Hub Manager|
:Inspect executive KPI dashboard and charts;
if (Manager chooses to export document?) then (Yes)
  :Select export format (PDF / Excel);
  :Click 'Export Report';
  |SaigonBite System|
  :Generate formatted PDF report document;
  :Record report generation audit trail log;
  :Provide secure direct download link;
  |Hub Manager|
  :Download and archive report file;
  stop
else (No)
  stop
endif

@enduml